{"id":"n89801-5-8","stage":1,"title":"잊어버리다 · 废寝忘食","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89801-5-8-1","ko":"지수가 열심히 공부하네.","zh":"智秀学习可真用功啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수가","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}},{"text":"열심히","meaning":"认真地","explanation":"열심히：认真地","readings":[{"term":"열심히","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67512","senseId":"1","lemma":"열심히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"열심히","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3"}},{"text":"공부하네.","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부하다：学习，读书；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"공부하다","audio":"/audio/002a60f979d8c3de292f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23394","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공부하네","audio":"/audio/621c4bb44be2f7061560.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5be015e332c130d8","term":"열심히","zh":"认真地","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3","entryId":"67512","definition":"对于某事专心诚意地。","pronunciation":["열씸히"]},{"id":"002a60f979d8c3de","term":"공부하다","zh":"学习，读书","audio":"/audio/002a60f979d8c3de292f.mp3","entryId":"23394","definition":"通过学习学问或技术而获得知识。","pronunciation":["공부하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3447c7c7461b22de7a8e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89801-5-8-2","ko":"밤에 자는 것을 잊어버릴 정도라니까.","zh":"简直到了连晚上睡觉都忘掉的地步呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"밤에","meaning":"夜，夜间","explanation":"밤：夜，夜间；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"밤","audio":"/audio/da9e530428ce1c2deaf3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74178","senseId":"1","lemma":"밤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밤에","audio":"/audio/9f09f2292c491f4b1b56.mp3"}},{"text":"자는","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자는","audio":"/audio/8d4ef1249ecbbf708044.mp3"}},{"text":"것을","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것을","audio":"/audio/bce7033cdb84462ff6a7.mp3"}},{"text":"잊어버릴","meaning":"废寝忘食","explanation":"잊어버리다：废寝忘食；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"잊어버리다","audio":"/audio/5a16c9c25daf9c4e4c13.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89801","senseId":"5","lemma":"잊어버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잊어버릴","audio":"/audio/2b7420e774adcd05d1cf.mp3"}},{"text":"정도라니까.","meaning":"程度","explanation":"정도：程度；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라니까：再次强调已经说过的内容，非敬语：“都说了……”。","readings":[{"term":"정도","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70876","senseId":"1","lemma":"정도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정도라니까","audio":"/audio/37ae160de7c67a9b6989.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da9e530428ce1c2d","term":"밤","zh":"夜，夜间","audio":"/audio/da9e530428ce1c2deaf3.mp3","entryId":"74178","definition":"日落到第二天日出前的黑暗时段。","pronunciation":["밤"]},{"id":"023aa5fb34178979","term":"자다","zh":"睡，睡觉","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3","entryId":"69511","definition":"闭眼睛，停止身体、精神活动，一时进入休息状态。","pronunciation":["자다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"5a16c9c25daf9c4e","term":"잊어버리다","zh":"废寝忘食","audio":"/audio/5a16c9c25daf9c4e4c13.mp3","entryId":"89801","definition":"做事过于专心以致于不能正常睡觉或吃饭。","pronunciation":["이저버리다"]},{"id":"1a771e4b7f99176b","term":"정도","zh":"程度","audio":"/